{"id":"bili-search","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"翻到啦～不过先跟你说清楚：我这是「按播放量排序」的搜索结果，不是 B站那个官方「全站排行榜」页面哈（我手上的工具翻不到官榜那张榜单）。就这份按播放量排的榜单来说——\n\n🏆 排行第一：**《【时长7小时】100首经典华语歌曲，8090后的歌单，都是当年火大街的歌曲！》**\n- 类型：**音乐区 · 华语经典歌曲合集（歌单类长视频）**\n- UP主：北流嘉措\n- 播放：约 3785 万\n\n所以第一是**音乐/歌单合集**类型的视频，靠的是「7小时100首经典老歌」这种超长陪伴型内容。\n\n值得注意的是，二三四名全被「世界记忆大师龙雅」的**毒蛇鉴定/科普**系列占了（科普·生物鉴定类），播放都在 2500–3000 万量级，也挺猛。\n\n如果你要的是**官方每日/每周全站排行榜**那种，我这边工具取不到，得麻烦你截图或者放行个入口给我，我再帮你看。要不要我再拉几条看看别的分区榜单？","tools":137,"toolNames":["bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_image","generate_image","generate_images","glob","grep","learn_meme","meme_list","meme_update","memory_append","memory_read","memory_rewrite","memory_search","oh_story_bundled_reference","oh_story_production","oh_story_role","pwsh","read","read_image","remember","screen_view","send_meme","soul_read","soul_update","st_add_worldbook_entry","st_apply_regex","st_bind_character","st_create_character","st_create_worldbook","st_delete_chat","st_edit_character","st_export_character","st_export_chat","st_get_character","st_get_chat_state","st_get_preset"